            "text": "For Sydney-based lolly enthusiasts looking for convenient delivery, several excellent online shops offer a wide array of sweet treats directly to your door.\n\nHere are some of the best lolly shops that deliver to Sydney:\n\n*   **Goody Goody Gum Drops** is a family-run online lolly shop that provides daily deliveries of bulk lollies across Sydney and all of New South Wales. They boast a vast selection, including exclusive lollies, Australian-made chocolates, retro sweets, and options for gluten-free and sugar-free diets. They also offer single-coloured lollies perfect for events and functions, all with low delivery costs to Sydney.\n*   **Lollylicious** specialises in handcrafted chocolate and lolly bouquets, arrangements, and hampers. They deliver across Sydney, NSW, ACT, VIC & QLD, utilising fine chocolates from brands like Ferrero, Lindt, Cadbury, Nestle, and Mars. They offer free Australia-wide delivery and even provide same-day delivery in Sydney for orders placed before 9:30 am AEDT.\n*   **Candy Bar Sydney** is a go-to for bulk lollies, chocolates, and party supplies, delivering to Sydney and nationally. They offer a diverse range, from sherbet and sour lollies to Aussie and American treats, and single-colour lollies for candy bars and events.\n*   **Dessert Boxes (Candy Collection Boxes)** offers customisable candy and lolly boxes with the convenience of same-day delivery for Birthday Dessert Boxes in Sydney and Wollongong. They provide national delivery, including same-day service for all metro states.\n*   **Wicked Sweets** offers a broad range of Australian, American, and British sweets, delivering Australia-wide with free shipping on orders over $99. They also have physical locations across Sydney.\n*   **Lolly Kingdom** provides a massive selection of over 300 lolly options, including a pick-and-mix feature, with quick shipping across Australia.\n*   **Joys Delights** imports a delicious and exciting range of candy from around the world, including America, England, Japan, and New Zealand. They also stock chips, chocolates, and drinks, and offer AfterPay and ZipPay as payment options.\n*   **The Lolly Barn** is well-regarded for its variety of lollies and American candy, offering fast delivery and excellent customer service with carefully packaged orders.\n*   **The Whizz Pop Candy Shop** delivers a large assortment of lollies, British and US sweets, and even savoury treats like Cheetos and Takis.\n*   **iCandy** offers a sweet delivery service, focusing on high-quality products from trusted suppliers, perfect for various occasions or simply as a treat."
          }
        ],
